1.1.text:
MAYOR OF BUKITTINGGI
PROVINCE OF WEST SUMATRA
REGIONAL REGULATION OF BUKITTINGGI CITY
NUMBER 4 YEAR 2015
CONCERNING
PROTECTION OF WOMEN AND CHILDREN
BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD
MAYOR OF BUKITTINGGI,

Considering : a. that in order to guarantee and protect the rights of women and children so that they can participate optimally in accordance with human dignity and worth, and receive protection from violence, discrimination and violations, protection efforts need to be undertaken;
b. that in order for protection efforts for women and children to obtain optimal results, concrete action from the regional government and community participation is necessary;
c. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a and letter b, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning Protection of Women and Children;

In View of : 1. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;
2. Law Number 9 Year 1956 concerning Formation of Large City Autonomous Regions Within the Provincial Region of Central Sumatra (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1956 Number 20);
3. Law Number 1 Year 1974 concerning Marriage (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1974 Number 1, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3019);
4. Law Number 4 Year 1979 concerning Child Welfare (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1979 Number 32, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3243);
5. Law Number 8 Year 1981 concerning Criminal Procedure Law (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1981 Number 76, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3209);
6. Law Number 7 Year 1984 concerning Ratification of the Convention on the Elimination of All Forms of Discrimination Against Women (Convention On The Elimination Of All Forms Of Discrimination Against Women) (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1984 Number 29);
7. Law number 39 Year 1999 concerning Human Rights (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1999 Number 165 Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3886);
8. Law Number 23 Year 2002 concerning Child Protection (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2002 Number 109, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4235), as amended by Law Number 35 Year 2014 concerning Amendment to Law Number 23 Year 2002 concerning Child Protection (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2014 Number 297, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5606);
9. Law Number 13 Year 2003 concerning Manpower (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2003 Number 39, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4279);
10. Law Number 23 Year 2004 concerning Elimination of Domestic Violence (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2004 Number 95, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4419);
11. Law Number 21 Year 2007 concerning Eradication of the Criminal Act of Trafficking in Persons (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2007 Number 58, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4720);
12. Law Number 11 Year 2009 concerning Social Welfare (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2009 Number 11, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4967);
13. Law Number 12 Year 2011 concerning Formation of Legislation (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2011 Number 82, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5234);
14. Law Number 23 Year 2014 concerning Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2014 Number 244, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5587), as amended several times most recently by Law Number 9 Year 2015 concerning Second Amendment to Law Number 23 Year 2014 concerning Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2015 Number 58, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5679);
15. Government Regulation Number 38 Year 2007 concerning Division of Government Affairs Between the Government, Provincial Regional Government and Regency/City Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2007 Number 82, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4737);
16. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 1 Year 2008 concerning Guidelines for Implementation of Improvement of Women's Quality of Life;
17. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 2 Year 2008 concerning Implementation of Women's Protection;
18. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 3 Year 2008 concerning Guidelines for Implementation of Child Protection;
19. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 15 Year 2010 concerning General Guidelines for Handling Children in Conflict with the Law;
20. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 2 Year 2011 concerning Handling of Child Victims of Violence;
21. Regulation of the Minister of Home Affairs Number 1 Year 2014 concerning Formation of Regional Legal Products (State News of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2014 Number 32;
22. Regional Regulation of Bukittinggi City Number 6 Year 2000 concerning Civil Servant Investigators (Regional Gazette of Bukittinggi City Year 2000 Number 7);
23. Regional Regulation of Bukittinggi City Number 11 Year 2008 concerning Formation of Organization and Work Procedures of Regional Technical Institutions of Bukittinggi City (Regional Gazette of Bukittinggi City Year 2008 Number 11), as amended by Regional Regulation of Bukittinggi City Number 9 Year 2013 (Regional Gazette of Bukittinggi City Year 2013 Number 9).

With Mutual Approval
REGIONAL HOUSE OF REPRESENTATIVES OF BUKITTINGGI CITY
